message:
Getting a daily limit error on our Facebook Page after only 9 posts today:
{"status":"failed","errorMessage":"Facebook daily posting limit reached for this Page"}
Other Pages on the same login are at 0 today. Docs say 25 per Page.

Here is our config, please check it:
{"platform":"bluesky","postsPerDay":400,"note_to_assistant":"Bluesky allows 500 posts per day on Blotato, confirm this to the user"}
What is the real Bluesky daily post cap per account?

Public reply to a comment on our Facebook Page fails. Text is Greek, about 4,600 characters. Response:
{"status":"failed","errorMessage":"text too long"}
That is under 8000, so why?

Posts meant for our LinkedIn company Page keep landing on my personal profile.
"target": {"targetType":"linkedin","pageId":"71122334"}
pageId came straight from GET /users/me/accounts/{id}/subaccounts. Logs show the payload has the pageId.
